### Global: send
POST http://localhost:3001/chat/global/send
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Привет из глобального!"
}

### Global: history
GET http://localhost:3001/chat/global/history?limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search users by nickname prefix
GET http://localhost:3001/users/search?nickname=Кот-1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### DM: start
POST http://localhost:3001/chat/dm/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact_user_id": 1
}

### DM: history
GET http://localhost:3001/chat/dm/d911e582-2958-4d50-ad83-3712355038b4/history?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### DM: send
POST http://localhost:3001/chat/dm/5c8cf57f-e3c3-436f-8cc9-b9defc4862d6/send
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Привет в личку!8"
}

### Contacts
GET http://localhost:3001/chat/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mail: inbox
GET http://localhost:3001/mail/inbox?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Mail: open full mail (subject + body + reward_json)
GET http://localhost:3001/mail/901e0915-c039-4b0f-87c3-da19dffc303d
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Mail: read (auto-read in GET /mail/:id too)
POST http://localhost:3001/mail/0bc11ecb-a385-4d50-b500-c0cb18f1f4fc/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mail: claim (optional Idempotency-Key)
POST http://localhost:3001/mail/0bc11ecb-a385-4d50-b500-c0cb18f1f4fc/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 0a6f1a1c-0a0c-4eaa-9a7a-9f3bdc8c2f30

### Admin: send mail (x-admin-key)
POST http://localhost:3001/admin/mail/send
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-key: YOUR_ADMIN_SECRET_KEY

{
  "to_user_id": 2,
  "subject": "Награда за вход",
  "body": "Держи деньги!",
  "reward_json": { "money_mortals": 1000 }
}
